</style></head><body><main><section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">JPMI Market Intelligence · Monthly Market Report</div><h1>September 2026<br>Japan Physical Silver Market</h1><p class="lede">September did not repeat July's premium shock, but neither did Japan's physical market fully converge with paper silver. Wholesale pricing weakened alongside COMEX, while the retail layer retained a materially wider premium and showed a clear improvement in observed transaction depth.</p><div class="tag">🟠 Persistent Physical Premium · Improving Retail Liquidity</div><p class="delta">Final month-end edition · Data through 30 September 2026 · JPMI official observation 19:00 JST</p></section>
<h2>Executive Summary</h2><div class="callout"><b>September's defining signal:</b> the JPMI premium remained moderate, but Mercari liquidity improved sharply from July–August. The market therefore ended the month with a healthier retail transaction profile even as absolute silver prices weakened.</div>
