54.2,86.4 293.4,101.1 332.7,50.2 371.9,117.6 411.1,86.4 450.4,104.5 489.6,141.9 528.9,101.7 568.1,95.5 607.3,151.0 646.6,90.4 685.8,164.6 725.0,123.2 764.3,107.2 803.5,122.1 842.8,123.8 882.0,130.6" fill="none" stroke="#f28b82" stroke-width="2.5"/><text x="538" y="18" fill="#f28b82" font-size="12">● MSPI-B</text><polyline points="58.0,182.1 97.2,188.5 136.5,178.5 175.7,184.9 215.0,185.4 254.2,188.1 293.4,179.6 332.7,198.8 371.9,195.3 411.1,203.3 450.4,204.0 489.6,195.7 528.9,185.6 568.1,180.5 607.3,180.4 646.6,184.5 685.8,188.3 725.0,192.9 764.3,186.3 803.5,209.8 842.8,211.8 882.0,208.9" fill="none" stroke="#c6a0f6" stroke-width="2.5"/><text x="698" y="18" fill="#c6a0f6" font-size="12">● COMEX</text><text x="58.0" y="258" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fa3b8" font-size="11">Sep 01</text><text x="254.2" y="258" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fa3b8" font-size="11">Sep 08</text><text x="450.4" y="258" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fa3b8" font-size="11">Sep 15</text><text x="646.6" y="258" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fa3b8" font-size="11">Sep 22</text><text x="882.0" y="258" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fa3b8" font-size="11">Sep 30</text></svg></div><p>JPMI-AG declined <b>7.7%</b> from ¥371.69/g to ¥343.20/g. COMEX in yen terms fell 7.1%, while refinery and dealer bids declined more sharply at 9.8% and 9.4%. MSPI-B fell only 4.1%, leaving the street market comparatively resistant to the wholesale decline.</p>
